#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:1
msgid "Portfolio, risk, optimization and simulation"
msgstr "投资组合、风险、优化与模拟"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:3
msgid ""
"Portfolio inputs own their typed positions, transactions, prices and "
"weights. The returned models copy or own their data; callers should not rely "
"on a view remaining valid after the source frame changes."
msgstr ""
"投资组合输入拥有其类型化的持仓、交易、价格和权重。返回的模型会复制或拥有其数"
"据；调用方不应依赖视图在源数据帧发生变化后仍然有效。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:7
msgid ""
"Risk and optimization APIs report infeasible, nonconvergent or unavailable "
"fits through documented statuses/exceptions instead of silently returning a "
"plausible-looking number. Simulation APIs take an explicit seed where "
"documented; matching a seed does not imply cross-language RNG identity."
msgstr ""
"风险和优化 API 通过文档化的状态/异常报告不可行、不收敛或不可用的拟合结果，而"
"不是静默返回一个看似合理的数值。模拟 API 在文档说明之处接受显式随机种子；相同"
"的随机种子并不意味着跨语言 RNG 一致。"

#: ../../site/guides/portfolio-risk.md:12
msgid ""
"The API reference lists the exact result fields, failure statuses and warm-"
"up requirements. This guide only describes the shared ownership and failure "
"model; it does not turn a deferred optimization experiment into a supported "
"feature."
msgstr ""
"API 参考列出了确切的结果字段、失败状态和预热期要求。本指南仅描述共有的所有权"
"与失败模型；它不会把一项暂缓的优化实验变成受支持的功能。"
